  excerpt: 'IWPR analysis of DOL RAPIDS puts women at 14.8% of apprentices with sex reported in FY 2023, up from 9.2% in 2014. Construction remains at 4.5% women while health and social assistance sits at 84.7%. The fastest shift is inside women???s own pipeline: health???s share of women apprentices rose from 5.6% to 16.0% (2016???2023) as construction???s slice fell.',
